    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obukama bwa Rehoboamu kabwabaire bwarama, wenene hamoi na Isiraeli yona balekera kukwata Amateka g'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka gwa katanu Omukama Rehoboamu aliire engoma, Shishaki omukama wa Misiri atabalira Yerusalemu, aha rw'enshonga ya Isiraeli kutahulira Mukama Ruhanga wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shishaki akatabara n'amagali 1,200 n'ab'efarasi 6,000. Abantu abo yarugire nabo Misiri abo bakaba bataina rubara. Omuli abo hakaba halimu Abalibya, Abasukimu n'Abaetiopia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebigo by'eboma ebya Yuda abikwata alemwa agoba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nirwo omurangi Shemaya yaizire ahali Rehoboamu hamoi n'abatwazi ba Yuda ababaire bakikiire Yerusalemu aha rw'enshonga ya Shishaki, abagambira ati, “Omukama nagamba ati, ‘Mumpoiremu, nanye nabaanagira Shishaki.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho abatwazi ba Isiraeli hamoi na Rehoboamu betohya, bagamba bati, “Eky'Omukama yakora ky'amazima.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo Omukama yaboine okwo bayetohya, agambira Shemaya ati, “Bayetohya; timbasilikye. Ndabarokora, Yerusalemu tinginagirane ka Shishaki agisilikya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe baraba bairube, nirwo baramanya enshororo eliho ahali bonene kutwarwa inye anga kutwarwa bakaba b'ensi ezindi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo Shishaki Omukama wa Misiri aija, atabalira Yerusalemu, atwara buli kantu; atwara eitunga lya Rwensinga y'Omukama n'ely'ekikaare, kandi atwara n'engabo z'ezahabu ezo Solomoni yabaire ahangire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha mwanya gwazo Omukama Rehoboamu ataho ez'omulinga, azikwasa abakuru b'abakumilizi b'ebihigi by'ekikaare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo yaijaga Rwensinga y'Omukama, abakumilizi abo bazihagatira, ahanyuma bazigarura omu nju eyo balindiragamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamu ayetohya, aho Omukama amugarulira, aba atakimusilikya, kandi n'omuli Yuda emilembe ebamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo Omukama Rehoboamu omuli Yerusalemu ashuba aguma, atwara. Orwo yagiire aha ngoma hakaba aina emyaka 41. Omuli Yerusalemu, ekigo eky'Omukama yaronkire omu nganda za Isiraeli kuba nimwo afukamirwa akatwaliramu emyaka 17. Nyina eibaralye yayetwaga Nama, Omwamonikazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai yashuba yahena, orwo atagondize Mukama na mutimagwe gwona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebikorwa bya Rehoboamu kwema aha mbandizo kugoba aha nzindo, bihandikirwe omu makuru g'Omurangi Shemaya na Ido, kaboni. Rehoboamu na Yeroboamu tibayoshaga kurashana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamu atahya, bamubyalira omu Kigo kya Daudi. Omutabani Abiya amusikira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
